Licensing for anti-slop-brain
=============================

This directory is part of the `anti-slop` repository and inherits its
licences. It is not separately licensed.

  Code (scripts/, tests/, schemas/, anti_slop_brain/)
      Apache License 2.0, see ../LICENSE

  Vault notes under wiki/markers/
      CC BY-SA 4.0, adapted from Wikipedia:Signs of AI writing.
      Copyleft: adaptations must stay CC BY-SA 4.0 and carry attribution.

  All other prose, notes, and documentation
      CC BY 4.0

Full terms are in ../LICENSE-CONTENT. Attribution is in ../NOTICE.

If you extract this directory
-----------------------------

This directory is built so it can be lifted out and used on its own: it carries
its own `pyproject.toml`, `install.sh`, `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` and
standalone CI workflow. Those relative paths above then break, and an extracted
copy on its own satisfies neither the CC BY 4.0 nor the CC BY-SA 4.0
attribution requirements.

Extraction is therefore only complete if you also copy `LICENSE-CONTENT` and
`NOTICE` from the repository root into the extracted directory, alongside a copy
of the Apache 2.0 text from the root `LICENSE`. Nothing in this directory is
relicensed by being moved, and the CC BY-SA 4.0 copyleft on `wiki/markers/`
travels with it.

